  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**10 \u00b7 Error handling.** The grpc-go client reaches server1 over three channels that handle a failure differently: **failfast** (the default: no connection, fail at once), **retry** (a retry policy: up to 5 attempts with backoff) and **waitforready** (wait for a connection, up to the 30 s deadline). Fill the top row with `make select-load-test EX=10 SCRIPT=errors/retries`: 20 req/s per channel for 2 minutes, with server1 stopped at 40 s and started at 55 s (annotated). The demo at startup fills the status code and low-memory rows."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Retries vs no retries: server1 goes away (errors/retries)",
      "id": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Failed requests per channel (k6)",
      "description": "Share of k6 requests that failed over the time range, for the runs in the \"load run\" dropdown. failfast fails for as long as server1 can't be reached, retry only saves calls that started in the last few seconds of the outage, waitforready fails none (its calls wait instead).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(k6_http_reqs_total{client=\"grpc-go\", run=~\"$run\", via=\"failfast\", expected_response=\"false\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(k6_http_reqs_total{client=\"grpc-go\", run=~\"$run\", via=\"failfast\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "failfast",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(k6_http_reqs_total{client=\"grpc-go\", run=~\"$run\", via=\"retry\", expected_response=\"false\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(k6_http_reqs_total{client=\"grpc-go\", run=~\"$run\", via=\"retry\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "retry",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(k6_http_reqs_total{client=\"grpc-go\", run=~\"$run\", via=\"waitforready\", expected_response=\"false\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(k6_http_reqs_total{client=\"grpc-go\", run=~\"$run\", via=\"waitforready\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "waitforready",
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "\u2013",
                  "color": "text"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^failfast( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3987e5"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^retry( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#d95926"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^waitforready( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#199e70"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
