    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 17
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Code | Here, when | What to do |\n|---|---|---|\n| `INVALID_ARGUMENT` | no key, no value, empty or unparseable OQL | fix the request |\n| `FAILED_PRECONDITION` | the region doesn't exist | fix the request (or create the region) |\n| `UNIMPLEMENTED` | an UNDEFINED query column; a method the server doesn't have | give up, report it |\n| `INTERNAL` | an empty region name; anything unexpected | give up, report it |\n| `RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED` | low memory (*running low on memory*) | back off, retry |\n| `RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED` | over the 4 MB message limit (*exceeds maximum size*) | split the request |\n| `DEADLINE_EXCEEDED` | the client's deadline, or the server's query limit | check the deadline, shrink the work |\n| `CANCELLED` | the client cancelled the call | nothing |\n| `UNAVAILABLE` | no connection to the server | retry (with backoff), or wait for ready |\n"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
